<h1>Redelegate domain to Business Catalyst DNS</h1>

<p>To redelegate a domain, visit your registrar's website and log in to their control panel. After you log in to your registrar, go to the domain management section. Update DNS servers for your domain.</p>
<h2>It's necessary to apply the following DNS server addresses:</h2>

<ul>
<li>ns1.worldsecuresystems.com (54.236.190.129)</li>
<li>ns2.worldsecuresystems.com (54.246.209.121)</li>
<li>ns3.worldsecuresystems.com (54.252.148.151)</li>
</ul>
